        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tapes of Entities is a first-person psychological survival horror game featuring alternate dimensions wreathed in darkness and beings ripped from nightmares. Tackle deadly puzzles. Survive threats both seen... and unseen. Piece together clues from an alien world. Above all else, avoid the grasp of utter madness when reality warps around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to explore the environment and solve numerous puzzles puzzles. You'll have to rely on your stealth and reflexes to survive. Investigate the warping reality, trying to uncover what is really happening.<br>Death lurks around every corner. Avoid dark entities which roam around you, deformed and symbolically designed to mock your very existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>story &amp; gameplay mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tyler 18 years old lives alone in his house..one midnight random tape appeared in house..when he saw the tape something  strange things starts happening in his house...the tape opens the portal for ghost entites..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game player should find and collect hidden tapes in the map..finding tapes are not easy..player should solves some puzzles to access in new area...there are ghost entities who are barrier of your progressions..face those entities and find all tapes to complete the game....</p>",
